        <Item class="ModuleScript" referent="2186">
          <Properties>
            <string name="Name">EvidenceManager</string>
            <string name="Source"><![CDATA[local EvidenceManager = {}

EvidenceManager.activeEvidence = {}

function EvidenceManager.addEvidence(type)
